\title{Connected}
\date{2026-09-13T04:25:02Z}
\tag{algorithms}
\taxon{Definition}

\import{algorithms-macros}

\p{Two vertices are \em{connected} if there is a [path](00LS) with the two vertices as endpoints.  A \em{connected graph} is one where every pair of vertices are connected.  A \em{connected component} is a maximal subset of connected vertices.}
